  "details": "Currently, the only ways you can remove a look from your avatar are:\n\n- Navigating to the looks menu in avatars, finding your current look, and clicking \"Remove\"\n\n- (improper) Adding a blank look that you can add to your action menu, with your avatar having nothing on it (which would need to be done multiple times for multiple avatars)\n\nIt would be much more convenient if there were simply one button in the looks action menu to remove the look on whatever avatar you are currently wearing.",
